f </span><span begin="00:33.030" end="00:33.240">you've </span><span begin="00:33.240" end="00:33.510">been </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:34.290">away </span><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.380">a </span><span begin="00:34.380" end="00:37.200">while</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.610" end="00:54.420"><span begin="00:41.610" end="00:42.180">Do </span><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.510">you </span><span begin="00:42.510" end="00:43.020">keep </span><span begin="00:43.020" end="00:43.380">the </span><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:47.970">receipts </span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.000"> </span><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.630">For </span><span begin="00:48.630" end="00:48.750">the </span><span begin="00:48.750" end="00:49.440">friends </span><span begin="00:49.440" end="00:49.860">that </span><span begin="00:49.860" end="00:50.190">you </span><span begin="00:50.190" end="00:54.060">buy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.420" end="01:05.730"><span begin="00:54.420" end="00:54.690">And </span><span begin="00:54.690" end="00:55.110">ain't </span><span begin="00:55.110" end="00:55.350">it </span><span begin="00:55.350" end="00:58.080">bittersweet </span><span begin="00:58.080" end="00:58.110"> </span><span begin="00:58.110" end="00:58.380">You </span><span begin="00:58.380" end="00:58.650">were </span><span begin="00:58.650" end="00:58.980">only </span><span begin="00:58.980" end="00:59.400">just </span><span begin="00:59.400" end="01:00.180">getting </span><span begin="01:00.180" end="01:01.890">by</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.730" end="01:11.790"><span begin="01:05.730" end="01:06.060">But </span><span begin="01:06.060" end="01:06.540">I </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:07.050">hope </span><span begin="01:07.050" end="01:07.320">you </span><span begin="01:07.320" end="01:08.940">know </span><span begin="01:08.940" end="01:08.970"> </span><span begin="01:08.970" end="01:09.300">That </span><span begin="01:09.300" end="01:09.720">it </span><span begin="01:09.720" end="01:10.200">won't </span><span begin="01:10.200" end="01:10.530">let </span><span begin="01:10.530" end="01:11.760">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.790" end="01:18.570"><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.090">It </span><span begin="01:12.090" end="01:12.660">sticks </span><span begin="01:12.660" end="01:13.380">around </span><span begin="01:13.380" end="01:13.710">with </span><span begin="01:13.710" end="01:14.160">you </span><span begin="01:14.160" end="01:15.000">until </span><span begin="01:15.000" end="01:15.180">the </span><span begin="01:15.180" end="01:15.570">day </span><span begin="01:15.570" end="01:15.960">you </span><span begin="01:15.960" end="01:18.540">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.570" end="01:24.570"><span begin="01:18.570" end="01:18.900">And </span><span begin="01:18.900" end="01:19.350">I </span><span begin="01:19.350" end="01:19.830">hope </span><span begin="01:19.830" end="01:20.100">you </span><span begin="01:20.100" end="01:21.720">know </span><span begin="01:21.720" end="01:21.750"> </span><span begin="01:21.750" end="01:22.110">That </span><span begin="01:22.110" end="01:22.530">it's </span><span begin="01:22.530" end="01:23.100">touch </span><span begin="01:23.100" end="01:23.370">and </span><span begin="01:23.370" end="01:24.510">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.570" end="01:30.330"><span begin="01:24.570" end="01:24.930">I </span><span begin="01:24.930" end="01:25.380">hope </span><span begin="01:25.380" end="01:25.530">the </span><span begin="01:25.530" end="01:26.190">tears </span><span begin="01:26.190" end="01:26.490">don't </span><span begin="01:26.490" end="01:27.060">stain </span><span begin="01:27.060" end="01:27.150">the </span><span begin="01:27.150" end="01:27.660">world </span><span begin="01:27.660" end="01:27.930">that </span><span begin="01:27.930" end="01:28.470">waits </span><span begin="01:28.470" end="01:30.300">outside</sp