 </span><span begin="03:26.520" end="03:26.880">That </span><span begin="03:26.880" end="03:27.330">it's </span><span begin="03:27.330" end="03:27.870">touch </span><span begin="03:27.870" end="03:28.170">and </span><span begin="03:28.170" end="03:29.340">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.400" end="03:36.180"><span begin="03:29.400" end="03:29.760">I </span><span begin="03:29.760" end="03:30.180">hope </span><span begin="03:30.180" end="03:30.330">the </span><span begin="03:30.330" end="03:31.020">tears </span><span begin="03:31.020" end="03:31.290">don't </span><span begin="03:31.290" end="03:31.860">stain </span><span begin="03:31.860" end="03:31.980">the </span><span begin="03:31.980" end="03:32.430">world </span><span begin="03:32.430" end="03:32.760">that </span><span begin="03:32.760" end="03:33.270">waits </span><span begin="03:33.270" end="03:36.120">outside</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.180" end="03:42.180"><span begin="03:36.180" end="03:36.480">And </span><span begin="03:36.480" end="03:36.990">I </span><span begin="03:36.990" end="03:37.440">hope </span><span begin="03:37.440" end="03:37.740">you </span><span begin="03:37.740" end="03:39.270">know </span><span begin="03:39.270" end="03:39.300"> </span><span begin="03:39.300" end="03:39.690">That </span><span begin="03:39.690" end="03:40.050">it </span><span begin="03:40.050" end="03:40.560">won't </span><span begin="03:40.560" end="03:40.890">let </span><span begin="03:40.890" end="03:42.150">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:42.180" end="03:48.990"><span begin="03:42.180" end="03:42.480">It </span><span begin="03:42.480" end="03:43.020">sticks </span><span begin="03:43.020" end="03:43.740">around </span><span begin="03:43.740" end="03:44.070">with </span><span begin="03:44.070" end="03:44.610">you </span><span begin="03:44.610" end="03:45.390">until </span><span begin="03:45.390" end="03:45.570">the </span><span begin="03:45.570" end="03:45.960">day </span><span begin="03:45.